          "Staging LFG: G1 (>=90), G2 (60–89), G3a (45–59), G3b (30–44), G4 (15–29), G5 (<15 atau dialisis); Albuminuria: A1 (<30), A2 (30–300), A3 (>300 mg/g).",
          "Empat pilar proteksi PGK/DKD (KDIGO 2024): (1) RASi maksimal, (2) SGLT2i (mulai hingga eLFG >=20, lanjut hingga dialisis), (3) Finerenone (eLFG >=25, UACR >=30, K <=4,8), dan (4) GLP-1 RA (semaglutide — FLOW).",
