          "studyHtml": "<h4>Komparasi Klasifikasi Hipertensi: ESC 2024 vs ACC/AHA 2025 vs PAPDI</h4><div class=\"med-table-wrap\"><table class=\"med-table\"><thead><tr><th>Pedoman</th><th>Kategori TD (mmHg)</th><th>Target Terapi &amp; Poin Pembaruan Kunci</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>ESC 2024</strong></td><td>• <em>Non-elevated:</em> &lt;120/70<br/>• <em>Elevated BP:</em> 120–139 / 70–89<br/>• <em>Hypertension:</em> <strong>≥140/90</strong></td><td>Target umum <strong>120–129 / 70–79 mmHg</strong> bila ditoleransi (ALARA); relaksasi pada usia <strong>≥85 thn / frailty berat</strong>; SPC dosis rendah awal.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ACC/AHA 2025</strong></td><td>• <em>Normal:</em> &lt;120/80; <em>Elevated:</em> 120–129/&lt;80<br/>• <em>Stage 1:</em> 130–139 / 80–89<br/>• <em>Stage 2:</em> <strong>≥140/90</strong></td><td>Stage 1 diterapi bila <strong>PREVENT 10-yr CVD ≥7,5%</strong>; <strong>hapus pemilihan obat berbasis ras</strong>; wajib cek <strong>UACR rutin</strong>; SPC untuk Stage 2; target <strong>&lt;130/80 mmHg</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PAPDI / ABPM / HBPM</strong></td><td>• <em>Office BP:</em> <strong>≥140/90</strong><br/>• <em>ABPM 24 jam:</em> <strong>≥130/80</strong> (siang ≥135/85, malam ≥120/70)<br/>• <em>HBPM:</em> <strong>≥135/85</strong></td><td>Wajib konfirmasi <strong>White Coat HTN</strong> (klinik tinggi, ABPM/HBPM normal) vs <strong>Masked HTN</strong> (klinik normal, ABPM/HBPM tinggi → wajib terapi!).</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
