        "Katz PO, et al. ACG Clinical Guideline for the Diagnosis and Management of GERD (Am J Gastroenterol, 2022)",
        "The Chicago Classification of Esophageal Motility Disorders, v4.0 (Neurogastroenterol Motil, 2021)"
