        "World Allergy Organization (WAO) / EAACI: Position Paper on IgE-Mediated and T-Cell-Mediated Hypersensitivity & Diagnostic Skin Testing",
        "Perhimpunan Alergi Imunologi Indonesia (PERALMUNI): Pedoman Praktik Klinis Prosedur Diagnostik Alergi di Layanan Kesehatan"
